

# ── Subject: type(scope): what changed  (≤ 72 chars)
#    types: feat fix refactor docs test chore perf style
#
# ── Body (optional): WHY, in 1-3 lines.
#
# ── Roadmap trailers: ONLY for product-level changes, as the LAST paragraph,
#    one per line, no blank lines between them. Skip them for small fixes.
#
# Product: what a user/judge can now do or see
# Decision: what we chose and why (ADR-0003 if it has one)
# Pivot: what changed direction and why
# Dropped: what we cut and why
# Next: what comes right after this
